{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-ruby-berry","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Ruby Berry","description":"\u003cp\u003eVELO nicotine pouches, Ruby Berry offers a blend of strawberries with tones of acidity. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur Ruby Berry flavour is available in the 6mg strength, perfect for moderate users. Conveniently sized and easy to use. With no smoke, smell, or tobacco, VELO nicotine pouches can be used anytime, anywhere.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e6mg Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Do not chew, suck or swallow these pouches – they’re only designed to be placed behind your top lip.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41990795001911,"sku":"VELO - Ruby Berry","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-ruby-berry-nicotine-pouch.webp?v=1763409075","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/velo-nicotine-pouches-ruby-berry","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




